Also, the RDS proxy have been tested with a local Notify instance running on my computer. The RDS endpoint was tunneled via the jumpbox to my local machine. I had to modify some code of the *notification-api* component to make it work but it was successful. This was done with the RDS manually created component. I will need to replicate the same with the infrastructure automatically created with Terraform once pushed.

